data: {"model_request":{"messages":[{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"reasoning_content":"现在需要立即调用render_algorithm。我需要构建steps数组。让我详细定义每个步骤。\n\n首先，定义步骤0：初始状态。\n\ndescription: \"Initial array. Pivot = 5 (last element). i = -1, j = 0.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [6,1,8,4,7,2,5]\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}  // 枢轴元素\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 0, label: \"j\"}  // j指针在索引0\n    // i指针不在数组内，不显示\n  ]\n\n步骤1: j=0比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[0]=6 with pivot=5. 6 > 5, so no swap.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [6,1,8,4,7,2,5]\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 0, role: \"comparing\"},  // 当前比较元素j\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 0, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤2: j=1比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[1]=1 with pivot=5. 1 <= 5, so swap arr[0] and arr[1].\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [6,1,8,4,7,2,5]  // 交换前\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 1, role: \"comparing\"},  // 当前比较元素j\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 1, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤3: 交换arr[0]和arr[1]\ndescription: \"Swap arr[0] and arr[1]. i becomes 0.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,6,8,4,7,2,5]  // 交换后\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 0, role: \"swapping\"},  // 交换元素1\n    {index: 1, role: \"swapping\"},  // 交换元素2\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 0, label: \"i\"},  // i更新为0\n    {index: 1, label: \"j\"}   // j仍在1\n  ]\n\n步骤4: j=2比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[2]=8 with pivot=5. 8 > 5, so no swap.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,6,8,4,7,2,5]\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 2, role: \"comparing\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 0, label: \"i\"},\n    {index: 2, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤5: j=3比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[3]=4 with pivot=5. 4 <= 5, so swap arr[1] and arr[3].\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,6,8,4,7,2,5]  // 交换前\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 3, role: \"comparing\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 0, label: \"i\"},\n    {index: 3, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤6: 交换arr[1]和arr[3]\ndescription: \"Swap arr[1] and arr[3]. i becomes 1.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,8,6,7,2,5]  // 交换后\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 1, role: \"swapping\"},\n    {index: 3, role: \"swapping\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 1, label: \"i\"},  // i更新为1\n    {index: 3, label: \"j\"}   // j仍在3\n  ]\n\n步骤7: j=4比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[4]=7 with pivot=5. 7 > 5, so no swap.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,8,6,7,2,5]\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 4, role: \"comparing\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 1, label: \"i\"},\n    {index: 4, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤8: j=5比较\ndescription: \"Compare arr[5]=2 with pivot=5. 2 <= 5, so swap arr[2] and arr[5].\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,8,6,7,2,5]  // 交换前\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 5, role: \"comparing\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 1, label: \"i\"},\n    {index: 5, label: \"j\"}\n  ]\n\n步骤9: 交换arr[2]和arr[5]\ndescription: \"Swap arr[2] and arr[5]. i becomes 2.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,2,6,7,8,5]  // 交换后\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 2, role: \"swapping\"},\n    {index: 5, role: \"swapping\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"pivot\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    {index: 2, label: \"i\"},  // i更新为2\n    {index: 5, label: \"j\"}   // j仍在5\n  ]\n\n步骤10: 最终交换，pivot就位\ndescription: \"Swap arr[i+1]=arr[3] with pivot arr[6]. Pivot 5 is now in its final position.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,2,5,7,8,6]  // 最终数组\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 3, role: \"sorted\"},  // pivot就位，用sorted角色\n    {index: 6, role: \"swapping\"}  // 原pivot位置，交换元素\n  ]\n  pointers: [\n    // 可能不再需要指针\n  ]\n\n步骤11: 可选，展示分区完成状态。\ndescription: \"Partition complete. All elements left of pivot (index 3) are ≤5, all elements right are >5.\"\nkind: \"array\"\narray:\n  values: [1,4,2,5,7,8,6]\n  highlights: [\n    {index: 3, role: \"sorted\"},\n    // 左侧元素可以高亮为visited或muted\n    {index: 0, role: \"visited\"},\n    {index: 1, role: \"visited\"},\n    {index: 2, role: \"visited\"},\n    // 右侧元素也可以高亮\n    {index: 4, role: \"muted\"},\n    {index: 5, role: \"muted\"},\n    {index: 6, role: \"muted\"}\n  ]\n  pointers: []\n\n现在，我需要将这些步骤转换为JSON格式。render_algorithm需要algorithm、description和steps数组。algorithm可以是\"quick_sort_partition\"。description是整体描述。\n\n让我构建steps数组。注意：步骤索引从0开始。\n\n我将使用JavaScript对象表示法，但需要确保是有效的JSON。\n\n另外，每个步骤中的array.highlights数组可能包含多个高亮，需要指定index和role。pointers数组包含index和label。\n\n现在，调用render_algorithm。","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_35d4566122b1468dacb645ed","function":{"arguments":"{\"title\": \"Quick Sort Partition (Lomuto) Visualization\", \"description\": \"Step-by-step partition of array [6,1,8,4,7,2,5] with pivot=5. Shows comparisons, swaps, and final pivot placement.\", \"algorithm\": \"quick_sort_partition\", \"steps\": [{\"description\": \"Initial array. Pivot = 5 (last element). i = -1, j = 0.\", \"kind\": \"array\", \"array\": {\"values\": [6, 1, 8, 4, 7, 2, 5], \"highlights\": [{\"index\": 6, \"role\": \"pivot\"}], \"pointers\": [{\"index\": 0, \"label\": \"j\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"Compare arr[0]=6 with pivot=5. 6 > 5, so no swap.\", \"kind\": \"array\", \"array\": {\"values\": [6, 1, 8, 4, 7, 2, 5], \"highlights\": [{\"index\": 0, \"role\": \"comparing\"}, {\"index\": 6, \"role\": \"pivot\"}], \"pointers\": [{\"index\": 0, \"label\": \"j\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"Compare arr[1]=1 with pivot=5. 1 <= 5, so swap arr[0] and arr[1].\", \"kind\": \"array\", \"array\": {\"values\": [6, 1, 8, 4, 7, 2, 5], \"highlights\": [{\"index\": 1, \"role\": \"comparing\"}, {\"index\": 6, \"role\": \"pivot\"}], \"pointers\": [{\"index\": 1, \"label\": \"j\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"Swap arr[0] and arr[1]. i becomes 0.\", \"kind\": \"array\", \"array\": {\"values\": [1, 6, 8, 4, 7, 2, 5], \"highlights\": [{\"index\": 0, \"role\": \"swapping\"}, {\"index\": 1, \"role\